{"id":"int-91d71f037c3438b8a0be8497f4d15264","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:03:03.626804Z","actor":"Dariusz Debowczyk","issue_id":"instructor-a214.2","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Extracted RequestMatcher contract + ExactHashMatcher (default). Deleted dead RequestRecord::matches(). Filename is now (streamPrefix, matcher fingerprint) only — matching fully decoupled from storage layout (sole key), so URL-normalizing/canonical matchers (R4) work without caller changes. Contract test proves swap-with-no-caller-change (collapsing stub matcher drives lookup). Verified: 182 http-client tests pass, phpstan clean. Files: Matching/{RequestMatcher,ExactHashMatcher}.php, RequestRecords.php, RequestRecord.php, tests/Feature/Http/RequestMatcherTest.php."}}
