{"id":"int-56f7d64a0348aecc0f11162bee84a529","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:07:14.414862Z","actor":"Dariusz Debowczyk","issue_id":"instructor-a214.4","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"RequestRedactor contract + DefaultRequestRedactor (masks authorization, proxy-authorization, x-api-key, x-goog-api-key, api-key, cookie, set-cookie; case-insensitive). Applied at persistence boundary: RequestRecords::save -> RequestRecord::createAppropriate(redactor) -> factories. Body preserved (participates in matching). Verified: unit tests mask each header; guard test scans tree for key shapes (AIza/sk-ant/sk-proj/Bearer); regression pin for R0 leak; E2E - live Gemini x-goog-api-key now [REDACTED] on disk, zero AIza strings. 185 http-client tests + phpstan green."}}
