{"id":"int-f2659e969055055a608dabb197a87e7f","kind":"field_change","created_at":"2026-07-06T11:24:01.77891Z","actor":"Dariusz Debowczyk","issue_id":"instructor-a214.3","extra":{"field":"status","new_value":"closed","old_value":"in_progress","reason":"Ambient injection seam done. HttpClientDefaults holder (http-client, default empty) consulted by InferenceRuntime + EmbeddingsRuntime ONLY on implicit-build branch via applyTo() - explicit-client examples untouched. examples/Support/HttpRecordingBoot reads INSTRUCTOR_EXAMPLES_HTTP + _RECORDINGS_DIR, registers RecordReplayMiddleware, provisions dummy provider keys for keyless replay (hermetic). boot.php wired. instructor-hub --record/--replay/--recordings-dir flags (set putenv + $_ENV + $_SERVER - found RunOneExample builds explicit env array from $_ENV/$_SERVER excluding putenv-only vars). VERIFIED e2e on real ComplexExtractionGemini via ambient path (no example edit): record 7 events + x-goog-api-key REDACTED on disk; replay 3x byte-stable 7; keyless replay OK; pass=0 middleware; hub flag replay 0.21s stable. 190 http-client + 509 polyglot tests + phpstan green."}}
